{"articleNo":"74517","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=74517&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013-2014 브루나이 정부초청 외국인장학생 선발 요강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.23","hit":"4087","attachments":[{"name":"모집요강(브루나이).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=74517&attachNo=72006"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2014 브루나이 정부초청 외국인 장학생 선발 요강을 붙임과 같이 안내하오니, 재학생들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가. 브루나이 정부지원 가능 기관: Universiti Burnei Darussalam (UBD), </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Universiti Islam Sultan Sharif Ali (UNISSA), Insititu Teknologi Burnei (ITB) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 선발요강 및 지원 관련 일체: 붙임1 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 장학기간: 학부(4년), 석사(1-2년), 박사(3년)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 연령제한: 18-25세(학부), 35세 미만(대학원)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">마. 지원기한: ∼2013.2.14(목)(기한 내 브루나이정부담당자가 접수한 지원자에 한함)</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">바. 지원관련 문의 일체: 주한브루나이대사관(02-790-1078/9) </span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">브루나이 정부(tad.scholarship@mfa.gove.bn /673-2266-1177(교환 387,386,380,383)</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">사. 관련 홈페이지: http://www.mofat.gov.bn/index.php/bd-scholarship-2013-2014 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 &nbsp;브루나이 정부초청 외국인 장학생 선발모집요강 및 안내자료 일체(영문)1부. &nbsp;끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
